Release: 24 September 2026 WP6 standalone synthetic cooling and thermal storage engineering experiment. Deterministic 24-hour single-zone 1R1C physics with common 24–26 C comfort and equal beginning/end room/store states; conventional AC, early pre-cooling and separately charged chilled-water storage; temperature-dependent authored COP, storage loss, charging penalty/pump, full-day vs evening peak/energy, 9 capacity x COP sensitivity reruns, complete downloadable hourly traces. Pathways dynamic charts and source-method chapter, 16 source-scoped workstreams. All model outputs are illustrative, NOT real Kerala temperature, measured AC fleet, SLA hourly grid data, statewide MW, rupees, carbon, annual energy or solved 2040 outcome; prior source analyses remain pinned.
